{"id": "gsm8k:405", "benchmark": "gsm8k", "started_unix": 1790753681.8547368, "first_event_seconds": 0.9370941910310648, "wall_seconds": 103.74909648305038, "prompt_sha256": "85badf675cba1a7e81abbd81ded5ce45cc8babf3f28f71b4dd22197c86fdca5d", "prompt_tokens": 143, "max_new_tokens": 512, "completion_tokens": 439, "finish_reason": {"type": "stop", "matched": 151645}, "request_id": "753c6f240d7e41a3827a84557dd2f8a6", "text": "To determine how much money Tyson would spend on meat and cheese for the muffins, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. **Calculate the number of sandwiches needed:**\n   Each sandwich serves 4 people. With 20 people watching the game, the number of sandwiches required is:\n   \\[\n   \\frac{20 \\text{ people}}{4 \\text{ people per sandwich}} = 5 \\text{ sandwiches}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Determine the amount of meat and cheese needed:**\n   Each sandwich requires 1 pound of meat and 1 pound of cheese. Therefore, for 5 sandwiches, the total amount of meat and cheese needed is:\n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ sandwiches} \\times 1 \\text{ pound per sandwich} = 5 \\text{ pounds of meat}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ sandwiches} \\times 1 \\text{ pound per sandwich} = 5 \\text{ pounds of cheese}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Calculate the cost of the meat:**\n   The cost of meat is $7.00 per pound. Therefore, the total cost for 5 pounds of meat is:\n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ pounds} \\times 7 \\text{ dollars per pound} = 35 \\text{ dollars}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Calculate the cost of the cheese:**\n   The cost of cheese is $3.00 per pound. Therefore, the total cost for 5 pounds of cheese is:\n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ pounds} \\times 3 \\text{ dollars per pound} = 15 \\text{ dollars}\n   \\]\n\n5. **Calculate the total cost:**\n   Adding the cost of the meat and the cost of the cheese gives:\n   \\[\n   35 \\text{ dollars} + 15 \\text{ dollars} = 50 \\text{ dollars}\n   \\]\n\nThus, the total amount of money Tyson would spend on the meat and cheese is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{50}\n\\]", "final_answer": null, "gold_answer": "50", "gsm_numeric_answer": "50", "gsm_extraction": "last_number", "truncated": false, "events": 439, "entry_transfer_id": "4f0be391-35dc-43f9-ae39-3feb9364dd92", "completed_entry_released": true, "cleanup_seconds": 0.10758775001158938, "arm": "target", "dataset_sha256": "5591e964da8fd457f0e113d82330c84c94e6074b1ad80d1ee414dca751d893c3"}
